---
<details class="preview-environment-badge">
  <summary aria-label="Preview 测试环境说明">Preview</summary>
  <p>当前为预览测试环境。预览不代表最终品质。</p>
</details>

<style is:global>
  .preview-environment-badge { display: none; }
  html[data-preview] .preview-environment-badge { display: block; position: fixed; right: max(76px, env(safe-area-inset-right, 0px)); bottom: max(14px, env(safe-area-inset-bottom, 0px)); z-index: 45; color: #78350f; font: 600 12px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif; }
  .preview-environment-badge summary { cursor: pointer; list-style: none; border: 1px solid #fde68a; background: #fef3c7; border-radius: 999px; padding: 6px 12px; box-shadow: 0 2px 10px #0001; }
  .preview-environment-badge summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .preview-environment-badge p { position: absolute; bottom: 40px; right: 0; width: min(240px, calc(100vw - 100px)); border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px; background: #fef3c7; font-weight: 400; box-shadow: 0 4px 18px #0002; }
  html[data-preview] .replow-footer .footer-version-line::after { content: 'preview'; order: 1; border-radius: 999px; padding: 1px 8px; background: #fef3c7; color: #78350f; font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700; }
  html[data-preview] .replow-footer .footer-version-line::before { content: '预览不代表最终品质'; order: 2; flex: 0 0 100%; margin-top: .2rem; font-size: .78rem; font-weight: 400; }
</style>
